{"id":"n18286-1-7","stage":1,"title":"과자 · 饼干","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18286-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 맛있는 냄새가 나네요.","zh":"妈妈，有好吃的香味呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛있는","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냄새가","meaning":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","explanation":"냄새：气味，味道，香味，臭味；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"냄새","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58180","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나네요.","meaning":"发出，泛出，响出，有","explanation":"나다：发出，泛出，响出，有；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]},{"id":"a67d0d1b921d4bc4","term":"냄새","zh":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3","entryId":"58180","definition":"能用鼻子闻到的味儿。","pronunciation":["냄ː새"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出，泛出，响出，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"产生能察觉到的声音或气味等。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/97f25fe661193ada1bc5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18286-1-7-2","ko":"응. 너희에게 간식을 주려고 오븐에 과자를 굽고 있어.","zh":"嗯，正在烤箱里烤饼干，想给你们当点心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너희에게","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간식을","meaning":"零食，点心","explanation":"간식：零食，点心；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"간식","audio":"/audio/92eb1c6e981afb49af11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70703","senseId":"1","lemma":"간식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주려고","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오븐에","meaning":"烤箱，烤炉","explanation":"오븐：烤箱，烤炉；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오븐","audio":"/audio/bbac10ac8a8b45f3763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68005","senseId":"1","lemma":"오븐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"과자를","meaning":"饼干","explanation":"과자：饼干；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"과자","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18286","senseId":"1","lemma":"과자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"굽고","meaning":"烤，烧烤","explanation":"굽다：烤，烧烤；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"굽다","audio":"/audio/f7b2a704ff9bb3f2aae4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60102","senseId":"1","lemma":"굽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"92eb1c6e981afb49","term":"간식","zh":"零食，点心","audio":"/audio/92eb1c6e981afb49af11.mp3","entryId":"70703","definition":"两餐之间所食用的简单的食物。","pronunciation":["간ː식"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"bbac10ac8a8b45f3","term":"오븐","zh":"烤箱，烤炉","audio":"/audio/bbac10ac8a8b45f3763b.mp3","entryId":"68005","definition":"从上、下、两侧加热来使食物变熟的烹饪工具。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8cbae77b051c729e","term":"과자","zh":"饼干","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3","entryId":"18286","definition":"把牛奶、白糖等放入面粉或米粉中搅拌后烤制或油炸而成的零食。","pronunciation":["과자"]},{"id":"f7b2a704ff9bb3f2","term":"굽다","zh":"烤，烧烤","audio":"/audio/f7b2a704ff9bb3f2aae4.mp3","entryId":"60102","definition":"在火上把食物烧熟。","pronunciation":["굽ː따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a68c47c9fdae6ebf03de.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.845,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18286","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.3251,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，有好吃的香味呢。","嗯，正在烤箱里烤饼干，想给你们当点心。","这是怎么开始做这件事的呀？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，有好吃的香味呢。","嗯，正在烤箱里烤饼干，想给你们当点心。","这是怎么开始做这件事的呀？"],"answer":1}]}
